Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.29,0:00:04.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On the other hand, some physicists are concerned that if this supercollider works...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.29,0:00:04.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是就另一面 有些物理学家担心 如果超级对撞机真的成功了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:08.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it'll create a black hole and swallow up the Earth, ending life as we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:08.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会弄出个黑洞 吞噬整个地球 毁灭所有生命
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a bunch of crybabies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:13.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是一堆胆小鬼 不入虎穴 焉得虎子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No guts, no glory, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:14.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:14.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:18.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The School of Pharmacology is looking for volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:18.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}药学系正在找自愿者…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.31,0:00:20.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"We are testing a new medication for social anxiety...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.31,0:00:20.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“我们正在测试一种新药 用来对付社交焦虑…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:25.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...panic attacks, agoraphobia and obsessive-compulsive disorder."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:25.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恐慌症、陌生环境恐惧症以及强迫性神经症”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.61,0:00:28.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would they be looking for test subjects here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.61,0:00:28.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们为什么跑来这里找测试对象？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:31.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:31.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:34.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe the comic-book store doesn't have a bulletin board.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:34.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许漫画店里没有公告栏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:40.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's going on? -Shh! Hot girl in Sheldon's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:40.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么回事？ -谢尔顿办公室里有个辣妹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:42.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:42.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿的办公室？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.79,0:00:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is she lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.79,0:00:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她迷路了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think so. I followed her here from the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该不是 我从停车场一直跟踪她到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:56.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Maybe she's his lawyer. -Well, she's free to examine my briefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:56.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-或许她是他的律师 -那她可以无条件审理我的案件
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:58.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard-- -I know, I'm disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:58.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德… -我知道 我很变态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:00:59.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:00:59.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我应该被惩罚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By her. Oh, look, I did it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被她惩罚 哎呀 我又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:06.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MISSY: Well, that should do it. -Thank you for coming by.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:06.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那应该就可以了 -多谢你过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:13.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-哈喽 -嘿！朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:20.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:20.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.66,0:01:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry I'm late. I'm working on a project...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.66,0:01:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我来迟了 我现在正在处理的项目
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:26.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that may take me up on the next space shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:26.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有可能让我登上下次升空的太空船
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:29.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, how can you be late? I wasn't expecting you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:29.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么会迟到？我又没在等你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nobody ever expects me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从来都没人等我出现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:34.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sometimes you just look, and bam, Howard Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:34.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但有时你若一转头 就会看到霍华德沃洛维茨！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:40.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, are you gonna introduce us? -Oh, all right. This is Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:39.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要帮我们介绍一下吗？ -哦 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这位是米西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:44.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Missy, this is Leonard and Rajesh, and you've already met Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:44.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}米西 这是莱纳德 拉吉希 另外你已见过霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's nice to meet you. -You too, as well also.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-很高兴认识你们 -我也是 相同 一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:48.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:51.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how do you two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:51.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们怎么认识的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:56.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, he once spent nine months with my legs wrapped around his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:56.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的双脚曾经缠着他的头九个月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:01.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:01.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:02.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's my twin sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:02.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是我双胞胎姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She thinks she's funny, but frankly, I've never been able to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:06.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她觉得自己很幽默 但是我从来都不觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's because you have no measurable sense of humor, Shelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是因为你没有任何可以衡量的幽默感 谢利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:12.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How exactly would one measure a sense of humor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:14.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幽默感到底如何衡量？幽默感衡量器吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:14.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A humormometer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.93,0:02:20.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I think you're delightfully droll. Or as the French say:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.93,0:02:20.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为你很讨人喜欢 或者用法文说应该是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.47,0:02:22.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKS IN FRENCH]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.47,0:02:22.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 看我是否记得…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:26.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so let me see if I got this. Leonard, Howard and--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:26.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 霍华德和…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:29.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, what was your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:29.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 再告诉我一次你的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:57.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rajesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉希
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Missy, what brings you all the way from Texas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}米西 什么风把你从德州吹过来？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was it perhaps destiny? I think it was destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会不会是命运的安排？我觉得是命运的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:29.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My friend's getting married at Disneyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:29.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的朋友要在迪士尼乐园结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:33.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Destiny, thy name is Anaheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:33.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}命运的名字就叫阿纳海姆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:37.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I had to drop off some papers for Shelly to sign for my dad's estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有几份父亲产业的文件要谢利签字
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:41.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The papers could've been mailed. Mom sent you here to spy on me, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:41.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些文件大可用寄的 妈派你过来盯着我的 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:43.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess that's why they call you a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:43.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难怪大家都叫你天才
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.81,0:03:46.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They call me a genius because I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.81,0:03:46.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们叫我天才是因为我本来就是天才
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:50.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell Mom that I currently weigh 165 pounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:50.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你告诉妈 我现在75公斤…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and that I'm having regular bowel movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肠胃蠕动正常
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Enjoy the wedding. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你婚礼玩得愉快 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Whoa, whoa. -Whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:01.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If the wedding's not till tomorrow, why don't you stay with us tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:01.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}婚礼如果明天才举行 你今晚就住我们那边吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:04.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I don't think so. Shelly doesn't like company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:04.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好吧 谢利不喜欢有客人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even as a little boy, he'd send his imaginary friends home at the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}即使小时候他每天晚上也都会请 他想象中的朋友回家去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:12.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They were not friends. They were imaginary colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:12.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们才不是朋友 他们是想象中的同事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:15.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, you're here, and we have plenty of room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:15.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你都来了 我们有很多空房间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:19.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, we don't. -Come on, Shelly, she's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:19.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-才没有 -别这样 谢利 她是你家人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:23.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what? I don't issue invitations to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:23.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那又怎样？我平常也不邀请你妈妈过来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:26.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It would be nice not to have to drive to Anaheim in rush hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:26.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用在塞车时段开回阿纳海姆倒是挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.39,0:04:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And don't ever call me Shelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.39,0:04:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有 别叫我谢利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:31.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So it's settled. You'll stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:31.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这么说定了 你住我们那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:34.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll walk you to your car. You're in Structure 3, Level C, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:34.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我陪你走去拿车 你停在第三栋C层 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}究竟是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So anyway, we're 8 years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们八岁时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and Sheldon converts my Easy-Bake Oven to some kind of high-powered furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿把我的玩具烤箱改装成了高性能熔炉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:51.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's just classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:51.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好经典！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:54.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I needed a place to fire ceramic semiconductor substrates...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:54.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要一个地方烧半导体陶瓷基板…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:56.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for homemade integrated circuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:56.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做自制式整合电路板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.84,0:05:00.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was trying to build some sort of armed robot to keep me out of his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.84,0:05:00.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要做一个武装机器人好阻止我进他的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.51,0:05:04.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Made necessary by her insistence on going into my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.51,0:05:04.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她一直执意想进我的房间 必须进行阻挡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:08.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I make those little muffins they give you. There's a big flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:08.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打算做几个小蛋糕 结果一道闪光
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:10.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Next thing you know, my eyebrows are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的眉毛全烧光了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:14.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not your eyebrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:14.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的眉毛？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep, I had to go through the entire second grade...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 结果我整个二年级…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:19.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with crooked eyebrows my mom drew on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:19.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈天天帮我画上歪七扭八的眉毛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:21.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that what that was? I just assumed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:21.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢 原来是这么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that the second-grade curriculum had rendered you quizzical.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:25.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还以为你那时是被二年级的功课压得愁眉不展
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:26.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard, you left your underwear in the drier downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你把内裤留在了楼下的烘干机里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pfft.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:39.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Those are not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:39.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:44.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? They have your little name label in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:44.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？上面有你名字的标签呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:47.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, no, I use those...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:47.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的…我用那条…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:51.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...just to polish up my spearfishing equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:51.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}擦拭我的刺鱼器具
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:54.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I spearfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:54.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会刺鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:01.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I'm not crossbow hunting, I spearfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:01.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不用十字弓狩猎的时候都会去刺鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, this is Sheldon's twin sister. Missy, this is our neighbor Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 这位是谢尔顿的双胞胎姐姐米西 米西 这位是我们的邻居佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.41,0:06:09.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. -Wow, you don't look that much alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.41,0:06:09.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 -哇！你们俩完全不像嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I get a hallelujah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请大家高喊“感谢神”！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fraternal twins come from two separate eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}异卵双胞胎是两个卵子形成的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They are no more alike than any other siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和一般的手足没两样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:19.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:19.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感谢神！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿！猜怎么着？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been accepted as a test subject for a drug...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:25.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我被选中接受治疗害羞病症的药物测试
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to overcome pathological shyness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:29.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, good for you, Raj. -Yes, I'm very hopeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:29.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-太好了 拉吉 -是的 我满怀希望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:30.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:30.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 米西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:43.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They mentioned there may be side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:43.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们说可能会有副作用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:46.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Missy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:50.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}米西 你可曾遇过来自异国风情浓厚的印度人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...have you ever met a man from the exotic subcontinent of India?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:56.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, there's Dr. Patel at our church. -Yes, Patel. Good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:56.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们教堂有个帕特尔医生 -是的 帕特尔 好人一个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:59.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you like motorcycles? Because I ride a hog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:59.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你喜欢摩托车吗？因为我骑哈雷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:03.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A hog? You have a two-cylinder scooter with a basket in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:03.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还哈雷？你骑的是前面挂篮子的小摩托！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:08.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You still have to wear a helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是一样得戴安全帽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:12.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Have you ever heard of the Kama Sutra? -The sex book.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:12.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你有没有听过《性爱宝典》？ -性书
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Indian sex book.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}印度性书
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:18.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In other words, if you wonder, wonder who wrote the book of love...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是说 如果你不晓得是什么人 写下那本爱之书 那就是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:20.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it was us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:25.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So Sheldon's sister is pretty cute, huh? -I wasn't staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:25.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿的姐姐挺漂亮的嘛 -我没盯着她看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:29.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't say you were. I just said she was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:29.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我又没说你有 我只是说她很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Eh....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:35.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe. If you like women who are tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:35.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许吧 如果你喜欢女人又高…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.37,0:07:38.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.37,0:07:38.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又完美的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, why are you ignoring your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你为什么都不理你姐姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:46.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not ignoring my sister. I'm ignoring all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:46.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有不理我姐姐 我是在不理你们大家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.13,0:07:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I brought snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.13,0:07:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}零食来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:52.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my. Gherkins and....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:52.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天…是腌黄瓜和…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:55.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Onion dip. It's onion dip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:55.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}洋葱沾酱…是洋葱沾酱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:00.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We don't entertain much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:00.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们平常没什么客人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:04.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Missy. Do you enjoy pajamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:04.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}米西 你喜欢睡衣吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:07.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I guess. -Yeah, we Indians invented them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:07.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大概吧 -是印度人发明的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:14.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, my people invented circumcision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:14.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们那边的人发明了割包皮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:24.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Missy, I'm gonna go get my nails done. Do you wanna come?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:24.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}米西 我要去做指甲 你要一起去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:27.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, yes. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:27.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天！我要！谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:29.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:29.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:31.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Bye, guys. -Bye, Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:31.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见 大家 -再见 米西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:32.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye, Missy, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:35.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Goodbye, Leonard. -Yeah, no, bye, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:35.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见 莱纳德 -好 拜 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You two have to back off. -Why should I back off? You back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们俩得要退出 -为什么我得退出？你退出啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, this is my apartment, and she's my roommate's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 这是我的公寓 她是我室友的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So what? You've got Penny. -How do I have Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那又怎样？你已经有佩妮了 -我怎么有佩妮了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:48.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In what universe do I have Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:48.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在哪个宇宙里我有佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So I can have Penny? -Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那佩妮可以让我吗？ -不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:56.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, can I interject something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:56.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我能插一下话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:00.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm ordering pizza online. Is everyone okay with pepperoni?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:00.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正在上网订披萨 意大利腊肠可以吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:05.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, can I talk to you in private? -I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我可以私下和你讲句话吗？ -大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:08.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry, I was going to order you cheese-less.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:08.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心 我会帮你点没起司的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:10.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. SHELDON: It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:10.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -没关系…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.01,0:09:13.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lactose intolerance is nothing to be embarrassed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.01,0:09:13.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乳糖不耐症并不是件丢脸的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:18.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN INDIAN ACCENT] I'm a fancy Indian man. We invented pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:18.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是有趣的印度人 我们发明了睡衣！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.81,0:09:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, look at me, I don't have a foreskin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.81,0:09:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 快瞧我啊！我没包皮！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:30.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:30.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.32,0:09:35.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you aware that your sister is an incredibly attractive woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.32,0:09:35.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知不知道你姐姐非常性感迷人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.91,0:09:38.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.91,0:09:38.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的比例是不错 身体脂肪数也低…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:42.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She has the symmetry and low body fat that Western culture deems desirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:42.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有符合西方文化的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:45.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's noteworthy that at other points in history...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:45.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然而值得注意的是 在历史上…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:50.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...heavier women were the standard for beauty because girth suggested affluence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:47.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}较胖的女人被视为美貌代表
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她们的庞大体积代表着富裕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's fascinating-- -I didn't say fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真有意思 -我没说是有意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:54.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I said it was noteworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:54.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说的是值得注意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:58.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:58.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 我注意到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:01.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But my point is that Koothrappali and Wolowitz....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:01.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的意思是库萨帕里和沃洛维茨…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:05.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're hitting on your sister. Ugh. It's....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们想泡你姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:11.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Okay. You know, I don't want to criticize your rhetorical style...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:11.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不喜欢批评你这种拐弯抹角的说话方式…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:13.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but we'd be further along in this conversation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:13.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们已经谈了这么久的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.99,0:10:16.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if you'd begun with that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.99,0:10:16.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该老早点把重点说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:17.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's great, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:17.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那很好 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We took quite a detour from what I understand to be your thesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}咱们绕了那么多不必要的弯 我才明白你的中心思想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:22.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:22.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随便啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:26.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You have to do something about it. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:26.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你必须做出点反应 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because she's your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她是你姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:31.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:31.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.59,0:10:34.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, we shared a uterus for nine months.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.59,0:10:34.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 我们曾经同住过一个子宫九个月
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:37.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But since then, we've pretty much gone our own separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:37.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但从那之后 我们便分道扬镳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, consider this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 你想想看…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:44.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With your father gone, it is your responsibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:44.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你父亲不在 你现在身负责任确保…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:47.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to make sure that Missy chooses a suitable mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:47.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}米西挑选合适的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.15,0:10:52.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hadn't considered that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.15,0:10:53.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从没想过这点 我们是有同样的基因
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:53.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We do share DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So there is the possibility, however remote...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以是有可能性 虽然机会不大…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:59.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that resting in her loins is the potential for another individual...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:59.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在她的肚子里将来可能会存在着另一个…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:02.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as remarkable as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:02.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和我一样优秀的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:07.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exactly. And you owe it to yourself and to posterity...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:04.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:07.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以为了你自己以及你后代子孙…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to protect the genetic integrity of your sister's future offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你必须保护你姐姐下一代的基因完整性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:17.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. If someone wants to get at Missy's fallopian tubes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:15.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:17.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果有人想入侵米西的输卵管…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:20.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they'll have to go through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:20.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就得先过我这一关！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:33.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am Shiva, the destroyer. I will have the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:33.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是破坏神湿婆 我会得到那个女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:38.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm warning you. I was judo champion at math camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:38.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我警告你 我可是数学夏令营里的柔道冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. That's enough juvenile squabbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了！你们俩停止幼稚争斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You stop it. You stop it, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}住手！我说住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:46.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna settle this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:46.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要来裁决这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Neither of you are good enough for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们俩都配不上我的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who are you to decide that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你凭什么决定？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's the man of his family. You have to respect his wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凭他是他们家的一家之主 你们必须尊重他的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:56.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're out too, by the way. -Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:56.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你也出局了 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:58.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing personal. I'd prefer my niece or nephew...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:58.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟你个人无关 我只是不希望我将来的外甥女或外甥…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...didn't become flatulent every time they ate an Eskimo Pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一吃冰淇淋就会肠胃胀气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:11.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you so happy about? -I'm not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:11.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你干嘛那么开心？ -我才不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:15.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the medication. I can't stop smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:15.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我吃的药 我没办法停止微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now that Leonard's made me aware of how high the genetic stakes are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:25.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在莱纳德让我意识到基因的重要性…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we have to face the fact that none of you are suitable for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们必须坦然接受你们都不适合我姐姐的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute, Leonard made you aware of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下…是莱纳德让你意识到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:36.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We all make mistakes. Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:36.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}人非圣贤 孰能无过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:39.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, but I think you're missing a big opportunity here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:39.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我认为你错过一个大好机会 -怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How so? -Everybody knows genetic diversity...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:43.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每个人都知道基因多元化能产生优秀的下一代
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...produces the strongest offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not put a little mocha in the family latte?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么不加点摩卡在你们家的拿铁里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In principle, you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就理论上 你说得有理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:55.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But as a practical matter, need I remind you it takes experimental pharmaceuticals...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:55.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是就事实而言 我必须提醒你 你需要靠服用药物…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:59.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to simply enable you to speak to the opposite sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:59.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才能让你对异性开口说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:03.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you're focusing entirely too much on the drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:03.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为你太过着重于药物了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:10.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it because I'm Jewish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为我是犹太人？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:13.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I'd kill my rabbi with a pork chop to be with your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:13.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要能和你妹在一起 我愿意拿猪排敲死我的拉比
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:21.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This has nothing to do with religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:21.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这和宗教无关
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This has to do with the fact that you're a tiny man...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和你的矮小身材有关…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:26.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who still lives with his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:26.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有你仍和你妈住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.35,0:13:29.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, you are really being unreasonable. -Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.35,0:13:29.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你真的很不讲理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here. Eat this cheese without farting, and you can sleep with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:32.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是吗？ -来…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:35.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃下这片芝士 若你没放屁就可以和我姐上床
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MISSY: Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.53,0:13:44.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shelly, can I speak to you for a minute? Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢利 我可以私下和你讲句话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:51.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why does everyone suddenly wanna talk to me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:51.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么突然间每个人都想和我私下谈话？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:54.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Usually nobody wants to be alone with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:54.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通常没有人要和我私下独处的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:02.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We all make mistakes. Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:02.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}人非圣贤 孰能无过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:06.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:06.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:09.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not even gonna ask why you're pimping me out for cheese...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:09.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想问你为什么拿片芝士就让我去卖身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but since when do you care at all about who I sleep with?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是 你从何时起在乎我和谁上床了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:16.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Truthfully, I've never given it any thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:16.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老实说 我从来没想过…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:19.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but it has been pointed out to me that you carry DNA of great potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:19.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是刚有人提醒我 你的基因具有不错的潜力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:22.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What on earth are you talking about? -Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:22.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在讲什么？ -请听我解释…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:26.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, I'm a superior genetic mutation...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:26.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是个优良的基因突变…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:29.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...an improvement on the existing mediocre stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:29.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}平庸之辈中的进化版
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:33.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what do you mean, "mediocre stock"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:33.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“平庸之辈”是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:35.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That would be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:35.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But residing within you is the potential for another me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是你的体内有可能存在着另一个我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:43.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Perhaps even taller, smarter and less prone to freckling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:43.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许更高 更聪明 更少雀斑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:47.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A Sheldon 2.0, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:47.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以称为谢尔顿第二版
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon 2.0? -Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿第二版？ -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:54.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, I am not saying that I should be the sole decider of who you mate with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:54.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是说我是唯一能决定你可以和谁交配的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:57.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're not attracted, then the likelihood of conception will be reduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:57.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不喜欢对方 那么受精的机率便会大为减低
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:00.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You have got to be kidding me. -Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:00.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在开玩笑吧 -一点也不
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:04.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Frequent coitus dramatically increases the odds of fertilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:04.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}性交次数频繁能大大提高受孕的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Shelly, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 谢利 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:14.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, I've lived my whole life dealing with the fact that my twin brother is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:14.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这一生都得面对我的双胞胎哥哥是个…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:18.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as Mom puts it, one of God's special little people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:18.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}套句妈的话：“上帝的宠儿”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:21.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I always thought I was more like a cuckoo bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:21.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我总以为我是杜鹃鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:25.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A superior creature whose egg is placed in the nest of ordinary birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一种优越鸟类 把它的蛋放在普通鸟蛋里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:28.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The newly hatched cuckoo eats all the food...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:28.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚孵出的杜鹃鸟吃光所有食物…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:31.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...leaving the ordinary siblings to starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:31.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让其他平庸手足活活饿死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Luckily for you, that's where the metaphor ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算你走运 那个比喻到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought it ended at cuckoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你把自己比喻成杜鹃鸟后就讲完了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:42.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:42.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你听我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:45.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you wanna start acting like a brother who cares about me, terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:45.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你若想当个关心姐姐的弟弟 那很好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:47.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:47.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:50.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you try one time to tell me who I should be sleeping with...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:50.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是如果你再告诉我我该和谁上床…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:55.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you and I are gonna go round the way we did when we were little. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:55.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就得用从前小时候的方式解决这件事了 记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:01.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I have an alternate proposal. -Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:01.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我有另一个建议 -说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You donate eggs. We will place them in cryogenic storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你捐出卵子 我们把它们保存在低温储藏室
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:08.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will find an appropriate sperm donor for your eggs...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:08.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我负责帮你找合适的精子捐赠者…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...have them fertilized and implanted in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让卵子受孕 然后移植进你身体里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:12.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That way, everybody wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:12.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样一来皆大欢喜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:25.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Correction. Missy can date whoever she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:25.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我更正 米西想和谁交往都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:29.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Look, we have to settle this. -I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:29.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们必须解决这件事 -我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:33.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon's sister is hiding at Penny's because we've all been hitting on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:33.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿的姐姐躲在佩妮家 因为我们同时要泡她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's not hiding. She needed to call her grandmother, who's apparently very sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她才没有躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:37.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她需要点空间打电话给她重病奶奶…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and then I believe she has to wash her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后她还得洗头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you poor deluded bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这个搞不清楚状况的傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Don't start with me, dude. -You wanna go again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你少骂我！ -你想再来打吗？来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sit down. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-坐下 -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:52.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we're gonna fight over Missy, let's do it the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:52.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们要争米西 就得用正当的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:54.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The honorable way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:54.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}荣誉的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:55.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Ow! Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接招！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.31,0:16:59.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.31,0:16:59.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还想挨揍吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:03.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:03.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他倒地了 -一、二、三、四…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MAN [ON TV]: One, two, three, four--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-快点起来！ -别起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:10.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Come on, come on! Get up. -Stay down, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:13.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}七、八、九、十
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.11,0:17:13.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seven, eight, nine, 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:15.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BELL DINGS ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:15.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好棒！适者生存 不适者淘汰！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:17.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah! Natural selection at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:17.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为人类掉泪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:20.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I weep for humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失陪一下 我得去告诉米西这个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:23.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me while I go tell Missy the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Hi, Penny, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 莱纳德 -嗨 佩妮 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That guy Mike that you were dating, is that still going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和你交往的迈克 你们还在一起吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Pretty much, why? -Just catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是的 怎么样？ -只是问问看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:39.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, may I speak to Missy, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:39.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 我可以找米西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.10,0:17:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.10,0:17:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Leonard, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 莱纳德 有事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:48.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, since you're leaving, I was wondering if you'd like to go to dinner with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:48.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你快要回去了 所以我想请你去吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's so sweet. But no, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真好 我心领了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.99,0:17:54.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.99,0:17:56.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你有别的事吗？ -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:17:56.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do you have other plans or--? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:07.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Enjoy the rest of your evening. -Thanks, I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:07.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好的 祝你今晚过得愉快 -谢谢 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:17.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, here's something we didn't anticipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:17.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有件事我们没料到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:27.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you want, Howard? -I'm fine. Thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:27.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你想干嘛 霍华德？ -我很好 谢谢你的关心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:29.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've come to call on Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:29.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是来找米西的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:32.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:32.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}米西！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:37.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, Howard. -The Amazing Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:37.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 霍华德 -是“神奇霍华德”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:40.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do you like magic? -Not really, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:40.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你喜欢魔术吗？ -不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.99,0:18:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then you are in for a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.99,0:18:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那算是你赚到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:49.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Behold, an ordinary cane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:49.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请看 这是一根普通拐杖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:51.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HUMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ta-da.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（愿意和我约会吗？）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:01.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:01.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.93,0:19:04.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HUMMING]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（你确定？）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:20.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}米西！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, I apprec--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 非常感…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apprec--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Appre--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, honey, is your medication wearing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甜心 你的药效退了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:42.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, hi, cutie pie. I was hoping you'd show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:42.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 小可爱 我正希望你来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.02,0:19:48.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCREECHES]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:53.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCREECHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.71,0:20:12.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We had a dog who made a noise like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.71,0:20:12.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们家从前养过一只狗 也会发出那种声音
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:14.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Had to put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:14.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最后只好安乐死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:21.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any news you want me to pass along to Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:21.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有什么话要我转告妈妈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, she might be interested to know that I've refocused my research...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她或许会想知道我的研究重点已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:27.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from bosonic string theory to heterotic string theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:27.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从玻色子弦理论转到混合弦理论
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:31.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'll just tell her you said, "Hey."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:31.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就跟她说你说“嗨”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, it was pleasant seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:38.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 很高兴看到你 除了关于我睾丸的那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:38.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Other than that business with my testicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:41.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Shelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:41.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过来 谢利
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:49.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to know I'm very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:49.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你知道我很以你为荣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:51.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:51.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的？ -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:55.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm always bragging to my friends about my brother, the rocket scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:55.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我总是向我朋友吹嘘我哥哥是火箭科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You tell people I'm a rocket scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你告诉人家我是火箭科学家？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, yeah. -I'm a theoretical physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是啊 -我是理论物理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the difference? -What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那有什么差别？ -有什么差别？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:10.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Goodbye, Shelly. -My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:08.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见 谢利
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:10.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just tell them that I'm a toll taker at the Golden Gate Bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不告诉他们我在金门大桥收过桥费！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:21.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A rocket scientist, how humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:21.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}火箭科学家 好丢脸！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.56,0:21:49.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 杨博
